{"v":4,"catch":"Puzzletronics 是一款極簡主義的益智遊戲","desc":"在這個遊戲中，您將體驗移動部件以形成電子電路，同時聆聽平靜而輕鬆的配樂。\n這個遊戲不是電子電路模擬器，但在這個遊戲中使用電子設備會很有趣。\n\n特徵\n\n- 一個完全簡約的環境。\n- 平靜而輕鬆的配樂。\n- 70 個挑戰。\n- 各種電子元件。\n- 種類繁多的電子電路。","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2021-08-26","genres":["益智","策略","桌上遊戲","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe7eb259a2216d6a8ebd23477d33d15342efc3a62d52c1ad223b65fd8c342333.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b3a223a9f006fef1c08b3fe26776fe0abfc484c4738ec7cd2644cc6f0f3a44b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2e5e133993b0adeaf72e5b5e72f6347ffb6acd858ed3501ae9b2ff7d5ee8630.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1db2029e9ecc0239728c2fe732d7c784040aee0c52c3ef992ada66024fa4541.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dfb1fdf524b49e7bc40ace3251504adcafcc2bb90a9b71c9a317c5c3d1f077de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/93a8487150b3587eb75772b9848366f81a3658a157114e84387846e24125fc54.jpg"],"titleId":"01004b4014d90000","dlc":[]}